llow</strong>, <strong>Muffin</strong>, <strong>Sprout</strong>, <strong>Bubbles</strong>, <strong>Dumpling</strong>, <strong>Pudding</strong>, <strong>Biscuit</strong>. Best Puppy Names <strong>Scout</strong>, <strong>Rascal</strong>, <strong>Wiggles</strong>, <strong>Scooter</strong>, <strong>Bandit</strong>, <strong>Buddy</strong>, <strong>Gizmo</strong>, <strong>Oreo</strong>, <strong>Snickers</strong>, <strong>Biscuit</strong>. Best Kitten Names <strong>Whiskers</strong>, <strong>Mittens</strong>, <strong>Pounce</strong>, <strong>Nala</strong>, <strong>Simba</strong>, <strong>Loki</strong>, <strong>Cleo</strong>, <strong>Ziggy</strong>, <strong>Noodle</strong>, <strong>Sushi</strong>. Other Baby Animal Names Explore our name generators for {american-kestrel}, {american-black-bear}, {anthias}, {aldabra-giant-tortoise}, and {antechinus} to find the perfect name for your companion. Baby birds: <strong>Chirp</strong>, <strong>Pip</strong>, <strong>Hatch</strong>. Baby rabbits: <strong>Thumper</strong>, <strong>Clover</strong>. Piglets: <strong>Wilbur</strong>, <strong>Babe</strong>. Chicks: <strong>Peep</strong>, <strong>Nugget</strong>.\",\"image\":\"https://bestanimalnames.com/images/og/blog-best-animal-names-for-baby-animals.png\",\"inLanguage\":\"en\"}14:[[\"$\",\"script\",null,{\"type\":\"application/ld+json\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"$1d\"}}],[\"$\",\"script\",null,{\"type\":\"application/ld+json\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"{\\\"@context\\\":\\\"https://schema.org\\\",\\\"@type\\\":\\\"FAQPage\\\",\\\"mainEntity\\\":[{\\\"@type\\\":\\\"Question\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"Should baby animals have different names than adults?\\\",\\\"acceptedAnswer\\\":{\\\"@type\\\":\\\"Answer\\\",\\\"text\\\":\\\"You can choose a 'baby name' that they'll grow into, or pick a timeless name that works at any age. Many owners use baby nicknames that naturally evolve.\\\"}},{\\\"@type\\\":\\\"Question\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"How soon should I name a baby a