scover the sweetest names perfect for puppies, kittens, chicks, and all baby animals. Small but mighty cute!\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"9\",{\"property\":\"og:type\",\"content\":\"article\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"10\",{\"name\":\"twitter:card\",\"content\":\"summary_large_image\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"11\",{\"name\":\"twitter:title\",\"content\":\"Best Animal Names for Baby Animals: 150+ Adorable & Tiny Ideas 🍼\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"12\",{\"name\":\"twitter:description\",\"content\":\"Naming a baby animal? Discover the sweetest names perfect for puppies, kittens, chicks, and all baby animals. Small but mighty cute!\"}]]\n","/blog/$d$slug/__PAGE__":"1:\"$Sreact.fragment\"\n7:I[22016,[\"/_next/static/chunks/3i2zmhpv5m7u2.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/14mrh2-p_w84d.js\"],\"\"]\n1a:I[97367,[\"/_next/static/chunks/3i2zmhpv5m7u2.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/14mrh2-p_w84d.js\"],\"OutletBoundary\"]\n1b:\"$Sreact.suspense\"\n2:Ta6a,{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"BlogPosting\",\"headline\":\"Best Animal Names for Baby Animals: 150+ Adorable & Tiny Ideas 🍼\",\"description\":\"Naming a baby animal? Discover the sweetest names perfect for puppies, kittens, chicks, and all baby animals. Small but mighty cute!\",\"datePublished\":\"2026-06-18\",\"dateModified\":\"2026-07-06\",\"author\":{\"@type\":\"Organization\",\"name\":\"BestAnimalNames Editorial Team\",\"url\":\"https://bestanimalnames.com/about/\"},\"publisher\":{\"@type\":\"Organization\",\"name\":\"BestAnimalNames\",\"url\":\"https://bestanimalnames.com\"},\"mainEntityOfPage\":{\"@type\":\"WebPage\",\"@id\":\"https://bestanimalnames.com/blog/best-animal-names-for-baby-animals/\"},\"wordCount\":143,\"articleBody\":\" Few things in life are more joyful than naming a baby animal. Whether it's a new puppy, a tiny kitten, a fluffy chick, or a miniature rabbit, baby animals deserve names as precious as they are. This guide covers the sweetest, most endearing names for any young animal. Names That Mean Small <strong>Peanut</strong>, <strong>Bean</strong>, <strong>Pip</strong>, <strong>Dot</strong>, <strong>Tiny</strong>, <strong>Mini</strong>, <strong>Bitsy</strong>, <strong>Pixie</strong>, <strong>Midge</strong>, <strong>Niblet</strong>, <strong>Pebble</strong>, <strong>Atom</strong>. Cutest Baby Animal Names <strong>Button</strong>, <strong>Jellybean</strong>, <strong>Cupcake</strong>, <strong>Marshmallow</strong>, <strong>Muffin</strong>, <strong>Sprout</strong>, <strong>Bubbles</strong>, <strong>Dumpling</strong>, <strong>Pudding</strong>, <strong>Biscuit</strong>. Best Puppy Names <strong>Scout</strong>, <strong>Rascal</strong>, <strong>Wiggles</strong>, <strong>Scooter</strong>, <strong>Bandit</strong>, <strong>Buddy</strong>, <strong>Gizmo</strong>, <strong>Oreo</strong>, <strong>Snickers</strong>, <strong>Biscuit</strong>. Best Kitten Names <strong>Whiskers</strong>, <strong>Mittens</strong>, <strong>Pounce</strong>, <strong>Nala</strong>, <strong>Simba</strong>, <strong>Loki</strong>, <strong>Cleo</strong>, <strong>Ziggy</strong>, <strong>Noodle</strong>, <strong>Sushi</strong>. Other Baby Animal Names Explore our name generators for {american-kestrel}, {american-black-bear}, {anthias}, {aldabra-giant-tortoise}, and {antechinus} to find the perfect name for your companion. Baby birds: <strong>Chirp</strong>, <strong>Pip</strong>, <strong>Hatch</strong>. Baby rabbits: <strong>Thumper</strong>, <strong>Clover</strong>. Piglets: <strong>Wilbur</strong>, <strong>Babe</strong>. Chicks: <strong>Peep</strong>, <strong>Nugget</strong>.\",\"image\":\"https://bestanimalnames.com/images/og/blog-best-animal-names-for-baby-animals.png\",\"inLanguage\":\"en\"}0:{\"rsc\":[\"$\",\"$1\",\"c\",{\"children\":[[[\"$\",\"script\",null,{\"type\":\"application/ld+json\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"$2\"}}],[\"$\",\"script\",null,{\"type\":\"application/ld+json\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"{\\\"@context\\\":\\\"https://schema.org\\\",\\\"@type\\\":\\\"FAQPage\\\",\\\"mainEntity\\\":[{\\\"@type\\\":\\\"Question\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"Should baby animals have different names than adults?\\\",\\\"acceptedAnswer\\\":{\\\"@type\\\":\\\"Answer\\\",\\\"text\\\":\\\"You can choose a 'baby name' that they'll grow into, or pick a timeless name that works at any age. Many owners use baby nicknames that naturally evolve.\\\"}},{\\\"@type\\\":\\\"Question\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"How soon should I name a baby animal?\\\",\\\"acceptedAnswer\\\":{\\\"@type\\\":\\\"Answer\\\",\\\"text\\\":\\\"Name them as soon as you bring them home! Early naming helps with bonding and training. You can always adjust based on emerging personality.\\\"}}]}\"}}],\"$L3\",\"$L4\",\"$L5\"],null,\"$L6\"]}],\"isPartial\":false,\"staleTime\":300,\"varyParams\":null,\"buildId\":\"Vn-m7ZnH220y8-FGOgPuM\"}\n3:[\"$\",\"script\",null,{\"type\":\"application/ld+json\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"{\\\"@context\\\":\\\"https://schema.org\\\",\\\"@type\\\":\\\"BreadcrumbList\\\",\\\"itemListElement\\\":[{\\\"@type\\\":\\\"ListItem\\\",\\\"position\\\":1,\\\"name\\\":\\\"Home\\\",\\\"item\\\":\\\"https://bestanimalnames.com/\\\"},{\\\"@type\\\":\\\"ListItem\\\",\\\"position\\\":2,\\\"name\\\":\\\"Blog\\\",\\\"item\\\":\\\"https://bestanimalnames.com/blog/\\\"},{\\\"@type\\\":\\\"ListItem\\\",\\\"position\\\":3,\\\"name\\\":\\\"Best Animal Names for Baby Animals: 150+ Adorable & Tiny Ideas 🍼\\\",\\\"item\\\":\\\"https://bestanimalnames.com/blog/best-animal-names-for-baby-animals/\\\"}]}\"}}]\n4:[\"$\",\"nav\",null,{\"className\":\"max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 py-3 text-sm text-gray-500 flex gap-1 flex-wrap\",\"aria-label\":\"Breadcrumb\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"$L7\",null,{\"href\":\"/\",\"className\":\"hover:text-primary\",\"children\":\"Home\"}],[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"children\":\"/\"}],[\"$\",\"$L7\",null,{\"href\":\"/blog/\",\"className\":\"hover:text-primary\",\"children\":\"Blog\"}],[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"children\":\"/\"}],[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"text-gray-800 